why Every Horde quest of Maraudon in one run, lead-ins included.

# Maraudon's Horde quests in one guide: Orgrimmar, Mulgore, Shadowprey
# Village, the Centaur Pariah, the Shen'dralas chain to Woodwyrd, Willow, the
# caves before the door, one run, then the hand-ins and Moonglade. Steps
# already done are passed over, so the guide picks up wherever the chain
# stands.
#
# The chains:
# - Uthel'nay's 7068 Shadowshard Fragments (in the caves before the door).
# - Olana Brighthoof's 96776 An'she's Radiance (inside).
# - Vark Battlescar's 7029 Vyletongue Corruption; Selendra's 7064 Corruption
#   of Earth and Seed (Princess Theradras).
# - Willow's 7028 Twisted Evils.
# - The Centaur Pariah's 7067 The Pariah's Instructions (the Amulet of Union:
#   the quest needs the Amulet of Spirits and the five Khans' gems for it).
# - Shen'dralas: the Shen'dralar Pylon's 92914 Strange Pylons -> Mordent
#   Evenshade's 96010 Fragments of the Pylons -> 96018 Powering the Pylons ->
#   93016 A Brief History Lesson -> 93394 Meeting the Magister -> Mithera's
#   93341 Forlorn Gardens -> 93594 Word of the Woods -> Woodwyrd's 93404 Rot
#   and Regret (the Vial of Earth Song Water inside) -> 93601 Passing the
#   Blame (to Kog'thug the Brave).
# - Cavindra's 7044 Legends of Maraudon -> Celebras the Redeemed's 7046 The
#   Scepter of Celebras (both inside).
# - Zaetar's Spirit's 7066 Seed of Life (inside, to Keeper Remulos in
#   Moonglade).
#
# Left out: 93604 Agamaggan's Blood after Passing the Blame (it needs Razorfen
# Downs); 8635 Splitrock the Elder (the Lunar Festival).
#
# Inside: nothing in the data places the bosses, the Vylestem Vines, Celebras
# the Redeemed, Zaetar's Spirit, the Earth Song Splash or the Shard of Pure
# Light inside, so their goals stand at the door (@29.1,62.5, Desolace) with
# `group 5`. The bosses come in the order of the client's dungeon journal
# (Noxxion, Razorlash, Tinkerer Gizlock, Lord Vyletongue, Celebras the
# Cursed, Landslide, Rotgrip, Princess Theradras; Maraudos and Veng
# optional), not of a recorded run. Every quest goal is counted by the quest
# log, so a group that takes them in another order still gets each step
# ticked. The orange crystal pool, the Shadowshards, Kolk, Gelk, Magra, their
# spirits and the Nameless Prophet stand on the Desolace map, in the caves
# before the instance.
#
# Sources (facts only):
# - Quests, NPCs, items, objects and rewards: Polestar's reference data
#   (data/forever, built from QuestieDB Forever 1.1.4) and Polestar 0.4.1.1's
#   Codex page for the dungeon. The Pariah's quest lists the Amulet of
#   Spirits and the five gems as the items it needs; each Khan and each Khan's
#   spirit drops its gem, the Nameless Prophet the Amulet of Spirits.
#   Players' recordings (data/recorded) have the Amulet of Union's goal done
#   by Magra, in the caves (35.17,60.14); the data has no source for the
#   amulet itself. The vial comes from an Earth Song Splash, An'she's
#   Radiance from a Shard of Pure Light.
# - The door: QuestieDB's list of Forever's dungeons, as Polestar's Codex holds it
#   (data/codex/entrances.json). The client's group finder lists Maraudon as
#   one dungeon, not as wings.
# - The dungeon's size, levels and bosses: the client's group finder and
#   dungeon journal, as Polestar's Codex page holds them (five players, levels
#   46 to 55).
# - Shen'dralas has only the live client's map, so the guide's coordinates
#   are live ones (`coords live`); Desolace's are the same in both.
# INGAME: where inside do the Vylestem Vines, Celebras the Redeemed, the
#   Earth Song Splash and the Shard of Pure Light stand? How do the gems
#   become the Amulet of Union?

