step Three Khans and the Nameless Prophet
  tip The Pariah's quest needs the Amulet of Spirits, which the Nameless Prophet carries, and a gem from each of the five Khans: Kolk, Gelk and Magra (or their spirits) out here, Maraudos and Veng inside. All of them are elites.
