  along until leave
  collect 17684 x15 quest 7028.1 @29.1,62.5 group 5 -- Most of Maraudon's foes carry Theradric Crystal Carvings.

step Noxxion
  tip The first encounter in the client's journal. Noxxion or Noxxion's Spawn drops the Celebrian Rod.
