step The Amulet of Union
  tip The Centaur Pariah wants the Amulet of Union; the quest needs the Amulet of Spirits and all five gems for it. Players' recordings have it done here, by Magra in the caves before the door.
  collect 17758 quest 7067.1 @35.17,60.14

